title: "OpenDIVE: Python Client for Domain-based Integrity Verification Enforcement (DIVE)"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-03-31
url: "https://github.com/diveprotocol/opendive-client"
repository-code: "https://github.com/diveprotocol/opendive-client"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - dnssec
  - cryptography
  - integrity
  - python
  - protocols
abstract: >-
  OpenDIVE is a Python client library for the DIVE protocol, 
  a cryptographic protocol that leverages DNSSEC to verify 
  the integrity and authenticity of web resources.
